%% Online Polling System - AWS Serverless Architecture
%% Export instructions:
%% 1. Mermaid CLI: mmdc -i docs/architecture.mmd -o docs/architecture.png -b transparent -s 2
%% 2. VS Code: Use Mermaid Preview or Mermaid Chart extension
%% 3. Web: Copy into https://mermaid.live and export as PNG or SVG

graph TB
    subgraph ClientLayer ["Client & Delivery Layer"]
        Browser["User Browser (React + TypeScript on Vite)"]
        CF["Amazon CloudFront Distribution (OAC, HTTPS Only)"]
        S3["Private S3 Bucket (Block Public Access)"]
    end

    subgraph AuthLayer ["Identity & Access Layer"]
        Cognito["Amazon Cognito User Pool (Essentials Plan)"]
        BrowserClient["Browser App Client (SRP Auth, No Secret)"]
        TestClient["Acceptance Test Client (Admin Password Auth)"]
    end

    subgraph GatewayLayer ["API Gateway Layer"]
        HttpApi["API Gateway HTTP API (ap-south-1)"]
        JwtAuth["Native JWT Authorizer (Audience: Client IDs, Issuer: Cognito)"]
        Throttle["Stage Throttling (Burst 200, Rate 100 req/s)"]
    end

    subgraph ComputeLayer ["Compute Layer (AWS Lambda arm64, Python 3.13)"]
        CreatePollFn["Create Poll Function (POST /polls)"]
        ListPollsFn["List Polls Function (GET /polls)"]
        GetPollFn["Get Poll Function (GET /polls/{id})"]
        CastVoteFn["Cast Vote Function (POST /polls/{id}/vote)"]
        GetResultsFn["Get Results Function (GET /polls/{id}/results)"]
        ClosePollFn["Close Poll Function (POST /polls/{id}/close)"]
    end

    subgraph StorageLayer ["Data Layer (Amazon DynamoDB on-demand)"]
        PollsTable["Polls Table (PK: pollId)"]
        PollsGSI["GSI: status-createdAt-index (PK: status, SK: createdAt)"]
        VotesTable["Votes Table (PK: pollId, SK: userId)"]
    end

    subgraph ObservabilityLayer ["Observability Layer"]
        CWLogs["Amazon CloudWatch Log Groups (14-Day Retention)"]
    end

    %% Client Delivery Flow
    Browser -->|1. HTTPS Request for SPA| CF
    CF -->|2. Origin Access Control| S3
    S3 -->|3. SPA Assets HTML/JS/CSS| CF
    CF -->|4. Response| Browser

    %% Authentication Flow
    Browser -->|5. SRP Sign In / Token Retrieval| Cognito
    Cognito -.-> BrowserClient
    Cognito -.-> TestClient

    %% API Request Flow with JWT
    Browser -->|6. API Call with Bearer ID Token| HttpApi
    HttpApi -->|7. Verify Token Signature & Audience| JwtAuth
    HttpApi -->|8. Apply Rate Limiting| Throttle

    %% Route to Lambda
    HttpApi -->|POST /polls| CreatePollFn
    HttpApi -->|GET /polls| ListPollsFn
    HttpApi -->|GET /polls/{id}| GetPollFn
    HttpApi -->|POST /polls/{id}/vote| CastVoteFn
    HttpApi -->|GET /polls/{id}/results| GetResultsFn
    HttpApi -->|POST /polls/{id}/close| ClosePollFn

    %% Lambda to Data Layer
    CreatePollFn -->|PutItem| PollsTable
    ListPollsFn -->|Query on GSI| PollsGSI
    GetPollFn -->|GetItem| PollsTable
    GetPollFn -->|GetItem user vote| VotesTable
    GetResultsFn -->|GetItem counts| PollsTable
    GetResultsFn -->|GetItem user choice| VotesTable
    ClosePollFn -->|UpdateItem status=closed| PollsTable

    %% Atomic Vote Transaction Flow
    CastVoteFn -->|TransactWriteItems: 1. PutItem Votes, 2. UpdateItem Polls| StorageLayer
    StorageLayer -->|Action 1: Condition attribute_not_exists| VotesTable
    StorageLayer -->|Action 2: Increment counts & totalVotes| PollsTable

    %% Observability
    ComputeLayer -->|Structured JSON Logs| CWLogs
